Teien Casterwill was the Elder of the House of Strategists within the [[Casterwill family]]. {{source|Sophie on Trial}} At some point, she established contact with the [[Huntik Foundation]] and served as a member of the [[Huntik Foundation Council]] for some time, during which time she wore a mask in order to disguise her identity. {{source|Coming of Age}} 

When [[Focauld Casterwill]] contacted Teien about a Blood Spiral attack on him, she formally unmasked and introduced herself to the Council members as a liaison for the Casterwill family. [[Metz]] was the only one who was already aware of her true identity.{{source|The Casterwill Connection}} 

Teien later asked [[Sophie Casterwill]] and the Huntik team to activate the [[Blue Star]] and call the scattered family members out of hiding. She also gifted Sophie with her [[Enfluxion]] [[Amulet]]. {{source|The Titan in the Temple of Sun}}

At the Casterwill meeting [[Fortress of Iron Will]], Teien supported Sophie in her bid to organize a strike against the [[Blood Spiral]]. {{source|Sophie on Trial}} Teien later fought against the Spiral army and defended the Fortress. {{source|The Spiral War}}

During the final battle against [[the Betrayer]] and his [[Blood Spirals]], Teien fought from one of the [[Scramjet]]s and redirected several attacks at the [[Silent Soldiers]] and [[Bazela's Insect]] fliers. {{source|Lok and the Betrayer}} {{source|Dante's Return}}

